---
/* REF: MG-2026-ASTRO-EN-ABOUT-01 */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Corporate Dossier / About Us";
const pageDesc = "Mentor Group’s institutional structure, board-level strategic advisory credentials, and regulatory clearance capacity in Türkiye.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDesc}>
  
  <section class="py-xl">
    <div class="ledger-container">
      
      <div class="dossier-box">
        <div class="dossier-header-bar">
          <span class="ref-stamp">REF: MG-2026-EN-ABOUT</span>
          <span class="classification-stamp">[ CORPORATE DOSSIER / ARCHIVE ]</span>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-title-box">
          <span class="sec-number">03. CORPORATE IDENTITY</span>
          <h1 class="hero-main-title">Refined Strategic Oversight & Regulatory Competence</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">Mentor Group provides structured administrative oversight for foreign direct investments, company establishment, and state incentive alignment in the Republic of Türkiye.</p>
          <hr class="double-rule" />
        </div>

        <!-- Corporate Grid Section -->
        <div class="ledger-row ledger-row-2col">
          <div class="ledger-col ledger-col-split">
            <span class="sec-number">01. EXECUTIVE INTENT</span>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">Sovereign Regulatory Clearance</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
              Navigating bureaucratic corridors and licensing structures in an emerging market demands absolute procedural precision and legal diligence.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
              At Mentor Group, we operate as a highly disciplined gateway for global businesses entering the Turkish commercial ecosystem. We ensure that your entity establishment, capital structure, and licensing applications strictly satisfy all regulatory matrices, preventing costly compliance friction and maximizing structural efficiency from day one.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="ledger-col">
            <span class="sec-number">02. COMPLIANCE ASSURANCE</span>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">Bespoke Advisory Governance</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
              We maintain absolute confidentiality and B2B operational integrity, representing elite corporations, private equity funds, and international investors.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
              By operating in close coordination with our accredited legal, accounting, and fiscal partner networks, we provide a unified strategic oversight. We do not make loose guarantees; instead, we map out clear operational milestones, enabling board-level decisions to be executed with confidence.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="double-rule" style="margin: 25px 0;"></div>

        <!-- Ankara & Istanbul offices details -->
        <div class="offices-box" style="margin-top: var(--space-lg);">
          <span class="sec-number">03. OFFICES & DIRECTORIES</span>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">Our Administrative Headquarters</h3>
          
          <div class="ledger-row ledger-row-2col" style="border: none; margin-bottom: 0;">
            <div class="ledger-col ledger-col-split" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-line-muted); background-color: var(--color-bg-card); padding: var(--space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
              <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Istanbul International Liaison Office</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;">
                Positioned in Istanbul's primary financial corridor, our liaison office coordinates foreign capital registrations, bank onboarding, and strategic market-entry scoping.<br /><br />
                <strong>Address:</strong> Levent Loft, Buyukdere Cd. No:201, 34394 Besiktas/Istanbul, Turkey<br />
                <strong>Email:</strong> istanbul@mentor.group
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="ledger-col" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-line-muted); background-color: var(--color-bg-card); padding: var(--space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
              <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Ankara Regulatory Coordination Office</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;">
                Located near the sovereign ministries, our capital office handles direct submissions, Ministry of Industry licensing audits, and official incentive file revisions.<br /><br />
                <strong>Address:</strong> Mahall Ankara, Dumlupinar Blv. No:274, 06530 Cankaya/Ankara, Turkey<br />
                <strong>Email:</strong> ankara@mentor.group
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 25px;">
          <a href="/en/advisory/" class="btn btn-primary">BOOK INITIAL ADVISORY SESSION</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
